      "review": "For each place profile the coordinate disks give a product of at most B_j 2^(2jA) cells. The number of nonnegative profiles of total ≤ h is binom(h+f,f). In Q(ζ₈), with r=j=2 and H₁=1, the radii are 4096 and 65536. Conjugate units 3±2√2 give a two-minor calculation with local index sum A=4 and global shell h=5. Integral row additions preserve this candidate list."
